!/art-source/v36/variants/beatriz-eclipse-tide/ultimate-body-candidate.png
!/art-source/v36/variants/beatriz-eclipse-tide/vfx-repair-candidate.png
!/art-source/v36/variants/beatriz-eclipse-tide/walk-border-candidate.png
